003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-box umx-data-speed-wap\"> \n      \u003Cfigure class=\"umx-f1 lazy-imageom\">\u003C/figure> \n      \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-kings-3\" class=\"umx-p-tips\">*对局复盘开启方式：开启《王者荣耀》游戏后，滑动侧边栏打开游戏魔盒 - 游戏工具 - 点击“对局复盘”开启功能。\u003C/p> \n     \u003C/div> \n    \u003C/div> \n    \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-stage iqooneo11supreme-wifi umx-dark-mode\"> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-section\" data-track=\"{'type':'viewstate','params':{'cfrom':'00003','pagecode':'003','product':'iQOO Neo11 至尊版','block':'15','total':'42'}}\"> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-title umx-data-speed\"> \n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-1\" class=\"umx-main-title umx-56\">寰宇电竞 Wi-Fi 三芯片 \u003Cbr>三芯协同，处处主场\u003C/p> \n       \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-2\" class=\"umx-intro\">2 颗 Wi-Fi 增强芯片和 1 颗 Wi-Fi 电竞信号芯片，具备超远连接距离和超强穿墙能力，轻松联网，畅玩游戏。\u003C/p> \n       \u003Cul class=\"umx-data-items\"> \n        \u003Cli class=\"umx-li1\"> \u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-4\" class=\"umx-36\">5dB\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-5\">5.8G 频段信号提升\u003Csup>4\u003C/sup>\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n        \u003Cli class=\"umx-li2\"> \u003Cstrong uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-7\" class=\"umx-36\">80%\u003C/strong> \u003Cp uimix-text=\"iqooneo11supreme-wifi-8\">Wi-Fi 信号理论\u003Cbr class=\"umx-mb-show\">覆盖范围提升\u003Csup>4\u003C/sup>\u003C/p> \u003C/li> \n       \u003C/ul> \n      \u003C/div> \n     \u003C/div> \n     \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-box umx-data-speed-wap\"> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-wave-wrapper umx-left-wrapper\"> \n       \u003Ci class=\"umx-figure-wave lazy-imageom\">\u003C/i> \n       \u003Ci class=\"umx-figure-wave lazy-imageom\">\u003C/i> \n       \u003Ci class=\"umx-figure-wave lazy-imageom\">\u003C/i> \n      \u003C/div> \n      \u003Cdiv class=\"umx-figure-wave-wrapper umx-right-wrapper\"> \n       \u003Ci class=\"umx-figure-wave lazy-imageom\">\u003C/i> \n       \u003Ci class=\"umx-figure-wave lazy-i